---
import PhoneFrame from '../PhoneFrame.astro';
import Seal from '../Seal.astro';
---
<section id="imagine" class="paper imagine">
  <div class="wrap-wide grid">
    <div class="visual">
      <PhoneFrame tone="light" class="phone-gen">
        <video
          src="/brand/v2/imagine-generate.mp4"
          poster="/brand/v2/imagine-generate-poster.jpg"
          autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"
          aria-label="EchoFlow Imagine generating an image in real time"
        >
          <source src="/brand/v2/imagine-generate.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </PhoneFrame>
      <PhoneFrame tone="light" class="phone-result">
        <img src="/brand/v2/imagine-result.jpg" alt="EchoFlow Imagine generated image result" loading="lazy" width="288" height="624" />
      </PhoneFrame>
    </div>

    <div class="copy">
      <span class="kicker" style="color:var(--c-lavender)">Imagine</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Picture it.<br />Watch it form.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted">
        A dedicated creative workspace beside chat. Describe an image, pick a model,
        and watch the generation animation resolve into a result you can save, share, or reference.
      </p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><Seal size={22} fill="var(--c-lavender)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></Seal> Image &amp; video modes with model picker</li>
        <li><Seal size={22} fill="var(--c-lavender)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></Seal> Live generation animation in-app</li>
        <li><Seal size={22} fill="var(--c-lavender)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></Seal> Separate from chat — same app, different flow</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="section-link" href="/imagine">Imagine details →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .imagine { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); align-items: center; }
  .copy > * + * { margin-top: 1.3rem; }
  .checks { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.8rem; }
  .checks li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .section-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.5rem; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .visual { position: relative; min-height: 560px; }
  .visual :global(.phone) { position: absolute; }
  .visual :global(.phone-gen) { width: 210px; left: 0; top: 40px; transform: rotate(-6deg); z-index: 1;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 30px 48px rgba(103,80,164,0.28)); }
  .visual :global(.phone-result) { width: 244px; right: 0; top: 0; transform: rotate(4deg); z-index: 2;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 36px 56px rgba(20,30,50,0.26)); }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .visual :global(.phone-gen) { width: 180px; }
    .visual :global(.phone-result) { width: 214px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .visual { order: -1; min-height: 540px; }
    .visual :global(.phone-gen) { width: 40%; max-width: 210px; left: 3%; }
    .visual :global(.phone-result) { width: 46%; max-width: 244px; right: 3%; }
    .copy { text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .checks li { justify-content: center; text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
